r Claim Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/home-insurance-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Commercial & HOA Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/commercial-hoa-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Roof & Hail Damage Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/hail-roof-damage-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Tornado & Wind Damage Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/tornado-wind-damage-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Water Damage Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/water-damage-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Fire & Smoke Damage Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/fire-smoke-damage-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Ice Dam, Freeze & Snow-Load Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/ice-dam-freeze-snow-load-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Farm & Outbuilding Appraisal","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/farm-outbuilding-claim-appraisal/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Insurance Estimate Review","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/carrier-estimate-review/"}},{"@type":"Offer","itemOffered":{"@type":"Service","name":"Appraisal Umpire Services","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/indiana-claim-appraisal/appraisal-umpire-services/"}}]},"knowsAbout":["Insurance appraisal","Appraisal clause","Property claim valuation","Hail damage","Tornado and wind claims","Ice dams and snow load"],"openingHoursSpecification":[{"@type":"OpeningHoursSpecification","dayOfWeek":["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],"opens":"08:00","closes":"18:00"}]},{"@type":"WebSite","@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/#website","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/","name":"Indiana Insurance Appraiser","publisher":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"inLanguage":"en-US"},{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#webpage","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/","name":"Indiana Insurance Appraisal Process | 7 Steps","description":"The Indiana insurance appraisal process in seven steps: the written demand, appraisers and umpire, negotiation and the binding award.","inLanguage":"en-US","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"publisher":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/#business"},"dateModified":"2026-11-18","primaryImageOfPage":{"@type":"ImageObject","@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#primaryimage","url":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/assets/img/photos/documents-review.webp","width":960,"height":640},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#breadcrumb"},"mainEntity":{"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#howto"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Appraisal process","item":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/"}],"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#breadcrumb"},{"@type":"HowTo","name":"How insurance appraisal works in Indiana","description":"The stages of a property insurance appraisal under a typical Indiana policy.","step":[{"@type":"HowToStep","position":1,"name":"Confirm it is an amount dispute","text":"Appraisal resolves how much a covered loss costs. Before anything else, confirm the carrier has accepted coverage for at least part of the loss and that the disagreement is about scope or price, not whether the policy applies."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":2,"name":"Read the clause and the calendar","text":"Find the appraisal condition in your policy, note how long each side has to name an appraiser, and calendar the suit-limitation date. Appraisal may not stop that clock."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":3,"name":"Send the written demand","text":"Either side can demand appraisal in writing. The demand identifies the claim, states that the parties disagree on the amount of loss and names your appraiser or commits to naming one within the policy window."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":4,"name":"Both appraisers inspect and estimate","text":"Each appraiser inspects the property and builds or refines a line-item estimate. Good appraisers document measurements, photos and pricing sources for every disputed line."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":5,"name":"Appraisers negotiate line by line","text":"The two appraisers compare estimates item by item. Many disputes narrow sharply here, and an agreed award signed by both appraisers ends the process."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":6,"name":"The umpire decides what is left","text":"Items the appraisers can’t agree on go to the umpire they selected, or one appointed by a court if they couldn’t agree. The umpire reviews submissions, may inspect, and decides each item."},{"@type":"HowToStep","position":7,"name":"Sign the award and get paid","text":"An award signed by any two of the three panel members sets the amount of loss. The carrier then applies the deductible, depreciation and limits and issues payment under the policy."}],"@id":"https://indianainsuranceappraiser.com/appraisal-process-indiana/#howto"}]}</script>
